" እና የ መመዝገቢያ ማስገቢያዎችን:"

#: Control.ulf#OOO_CONTROL_145.LngText.text
#: Control.ulf%23OOO_CONTROL_145.LngText.text
msgid "Remove [ProductName] from your computer."
msgstr "ከ ኮምፒዩተሩ ውስጥ [ProductName] ማስወገጃ"

